   section one
   -flask
   - render_template tells flask to find an Html file in the template folder and display it to the user
   -"/" is the home page route to the wbsite
                1. Import Flask             tools.                                   
                2. Create a website called app.

                3. When someone visits the home page (/),
                    run the function home().

                4. home() shows index.html.

                5. If tracker.py is run directly,
                start the website.
section 2
Create a page where the user can enter a blood glucose reading.
-creating a button for add reading page
<a href="/add">
    <button>Add reading</button>
</a>
-add date
<label>Date</label>
<input type="date" name = "date">
-add time
<label> time</label>
<input type="time" name="time">
-add glucose
<label>Glucose</label>
<input type="number" name= "glucose">
-saving button 
<input type="submit" value="save reading">

